  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Paul R. Lawrence said he did not think everything would one day be done by bots. In a later reported statement dated April 20, 2026, he described taking a cautious approach and learning from others. He also said a new electronic health records system would allow VA to adopt the latest AI and robotics to help staff do better.",
