     "text": "Paul R. Lawrence said he did not think everything would one day be done by bots.",
     "sids": [
      "s1"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "In a later reported statement dated April 20, 2026, he described taking a cautious approach and learning from others.",
     "sids": [
      "s2"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "He also said a new electronic health records system would allow VA to adopt the latest AI and robotics to help staff do better.",
